  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For the project: Promoting and Protecting Women&apos;s Right of Access to Information</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x2018;Promoting and protecting women&#x2019;s right of access to information in West Africa&#x2019; project aims to improve access to information for women in Liberia and Sierra Leone. The objective is to help more women in Liberia and Sierra Leone to promote and protect their rights through access to information. The key activities include raising awareness of the right of access to information among all stakeholders; supporting national and local committees to steer efforts to advance the right for women; building capacity of government partners through gender sensitisation and FOI training to implement an equitable right of access to information; and providing technical assistance to national and local civil society partners to increase FOI use.</narrative>
  </description>
